/-!
# Exact CNF binding for the label-general center-exchange all-order
common-five family

This file binds all 2,546 realizable `(a, b, c, x, y)` roles of the
center-exchange delta family — the widened per-order exchange orbit minus
the strict all-order sub-orbit already installed by the parent — to the
deterministic positive-membership extension installed after the v24
all-order common-five family.  1,335 requirements reuse their exact
inherited parent-chain variables (44,876--47,136, non-contiguous).  The
remaining 38 requirements receive fresh variables 47,137--47,174.  Each
role contributes one three-literal block after 658 fresh deterministic
implications.

This is finite exact-twelve predicate ingress only.  It does not assert
terminal UNSAT, complete arm coverage, an arbitrary-cardinality lift, or live
Rigid221 closure.
-/

